flowchart TD
  A[Caller supplies PlayStation console ID plus file path or buffer] --> B[rc_client_begin_identify_and_load_game]
  B --> C[rc_hash_generate or rc_hash_iterate]
  C --> D[rc_hash_generate]
  D --> E{Iterator has buffer?}
  E -->|No: ordinary media path| F[rc_hash_from_file]
  E -->|Yes| G[Buffer-specific dispatch outside this CD fixture path]
  F --> H{Path extension is m3u?}
  H -->|Yes| I[Playlist hash path]
  H -->|No| J[rc_hash_psx]
  J --> K[Open track 1]
  K --> L[Find SYSTEM.CNF then parse BOOT cdrom entry]
  L --> M{Boot executable found?}
  M -->|No| N[Find PSX.EXE fallback]
  M -->|Yes| O[Read primary executable header]
  N --> O
  O --> P{PS-X EXE marker present?}
  P -->|Yes| Q[Use header payload length plus 2048-byte header]
  P -->|No| R[Retain directory-record file size]
  Q --> S[Append executable name then selected executable bytes to MD5]
  R --> S
  S --> T[Finalize identifier hash]

  classDef boundary fill:#fff2cc,stroke:#a67c00,color:#000;
  class G,I boundary;
